==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Rowlet|18}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier; the standard illustration and Pokédex entry are also the same.

===Origin===
*'''Skill Dive''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Crobat|3}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Rowlet}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

